          "dense_rank": 1,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 20,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.49293596,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": 5.420411,
          "lexical_rank": 4,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.4523911,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": 2.9391363,
          "lexical_rank": 14,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## The self-check-in kiosk\n\nReturning patients can check in at the kiosk beside the front desk instead of queuing. Scan the QR code from your 48-hour reminder text, or type in your last name and date of birth. The kiosk cannot take payments: any copay or self-pay amount is paid at the front desk.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 24,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.4372402,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insurer for potential reimbursement.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.43704632,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
          "chunk_index": 5,
          "similarity_score": 0.43552324,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": 9.148123,
          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Medicare and Medicaid\n\nWe accept Original Medicare (Part B) for medical visits. Medicare does not cover routine dental care, so dental appointments are self-pay for Medicare patients unless they also hold one of the dental plans listed in our dental care guide. We do not currently accept Medicaid or Medicaid managed care plans.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.4287392,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": 2.9536583,
          "lexical_rank": 13,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Ple",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 27,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.4255149,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": 6.1235447,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 28,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.41371882,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": 4.6783586,
          "lexical_rank": 9,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your regist",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.40616244,
          "dense_rank": 10,
          "lexical_score": 1.655427,
          "lexical_rank": 18,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more than 200 languages for any appointment. Ask for it when you book or when you check in; there is",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.39929172,
          "dense_rank": 11,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 21,
          "chunk_index": 0,
