          "similarity_score": 0.36773932,
          "dense_rank": 19,
          "lexical_score": 3.7097666,
          "lexical_rank": 11,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Registering as a new patient\n\nNew patients fill in three forms at their first visit:\n\n- Form PR-1, New Patient Registration: your contact details, emergency contact an",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.35730088,
          "dense_rank": 20,
          "lexical_score": 5.1050014,
          "lexical_rank": 5,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered Mo",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 38,
