          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 6.7603607,
          "lexical_rank": 2,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n## Dental insurance\n\nMedical insurance plans do not cover dental care. For dental appointments we accept these dental plans: Delta Dental PPO, MetLife PDP Plus and Guardian DentalGuard Preferred. We do not accept dental HMO (DHMO) plans, including Cigna Dental Care DHMO. If you do not hold one of the accepted dental plans, dental appointments are self-pay.",
          "text_truncated": false
